{% comment %}
  Trophy Mart Ã¢â‚¬â€ Category Showcase carousel (mirrors src/components/CategoryShowcase.tsx).

  Self-contained. Upload ONLY sections/category-showcase.liquid.

  Cards are section blocks ("Category card": title, image, link). While no
  blocks are added, the five built-in Trophy Mart categories are shown with
  a signature gold trophy icon placeholder. Auto-slides every 3.5s, pauses
  on hover/touch and when off-screen, like the React design.
{% endcomment %}

